notes.content:
List of changes:
* Fixed wrong camera zoom;
* Fixed a bug due to which after the first boss the life counter was not exposed;
* Fixed a bug where the interface periodically stopped working;

List of changes:
* Significantly reduced loading time;
* The counter of a record of coins is removed;
* Added the ability to buy lives, checkpoints and time in the pause menu for coins;
* Added the ability to adjust the camera distance in the settings menu;

Bugfixes:
* Fixed wrong camera distance after killing the first boss;
* Fixed a typo in laucher;

List of changes:
* Fixed hanging in the walls at respawn in some places;
* Reduced complexity in some levels;
* Removed traps, which the player could not visually see when falling;

In the near future, at the request of the players, we will make it possible to configure the camera (zoom+ / zoom-), and also fix the long load of the game.
